{
  "id": "d6d6e9ca3d3dc5121d2d7a6a",
  "title": "食指与舌头-名古屋美食记",
  "summary": "Momoji https://maps.app.goo.gl/6J8fUievvZ42LCdv6 一家开在地下街的意大利菜小店，人均消费比较高，四个人人均六千。但是菜色很有特点，水果和生火腿的搭配",
  "content": "<p>Momoji\n<a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/6J8fUievvZ42LCdv6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://maps.app.goo.gl/6J8fUievvZ42LCdv6</a>\n一家开在地下街的意大利菜小店，人均消费比较高，四个人人均六千。但是菜色很有特点，水果和生火腿的搭配叫人耳目一新。桃子酒也是一股真桃子味，十分好喝。\n<img src=\"https://blog.himikouchuu.com/api/blob/images/e9e28daf5103ed3601d1dba83effc5b9cc9b0826.jpg#blurhash=LTKuyX%252B6tQxa%23qkVX70zR%25rZNG&amp;width=3024&amp;height=3024\" alt=\"IMG_1426.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://blog.himikouchuu.com/api/blob/images/6f039316a6d32b688f2ec7470778496c852a53fd.jpg#blurhash=LQJ%7EGZOpt8R%25%7Dt%24%25O%3Bi%7B%5E5n%2Bb%5Bwc&amp;width=3024&amp;height=3024\" alt=\"IMG_1431_jpg.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://blog.himikouchuu.com/api/blob/images/34520d8b7cc785c8984c2542840f852d05c3a5e6.jpg#blurhash=LKJhv_GTxZIr%7DFxrJ8Ro%7D9oznlt3&amp;width=3024&amp;height=3024\" alt=\"IMG_1436_jpg.jpg\"></p>\n<p>Bar Español La Bodega\n<a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/sfXm5ZYPxaY2arUq7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://maps.app.goo.gl/sfXm5ZYPxaY2arUq7</a>\n一家身处重要地段的西班牙风味菜。价格太贵且捆绑消费，或许是因地价太贵所致。不过黄油火腿实在美味，鹅肝也很不错，别的实在不值得一点。\n<img src=\"https://blog.himikouchuu.com/api/blob/images/b2cd221656861cf310e2337932bea64d12f78eb1.jpg#blurhash=LGOoSA%5EjtR%7EC-VjGX8R%25%23*%2518_IU&amp;width=3024&amp;height=3024\" alt=\"IMG_2835_jpg.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://blog.himikouchuu.com/api/blob/images/48ff6ba688441914cdb7c31c94b80ef33b3aace8.jpg#blurhash=LHMF%3F%40-pr%7C%7EBo%23M%7BxWtlU%5E%24MIUNI&amp;width=3024&amp;height=3024\" alt=\"IMG_2836_jpg.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://blog.himikouchuu.com/api/blob/images/4528462745fba666afdbd36bb4f2b0d278cd88af.jpg#blurhash=LFI%7B%5DA%251yY%3DaOX-ot%2BI%3B7h%5E%2B%7D%40-p&amp;width=3024&amp;height=3024\" alt=\"IMG_2838_jpg.jpg\"></p>\n<p>TABASSUM\n<a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/aG5GNV27SMusgi9J8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://maps.app.goo.gl/aG5GNV27SMusgi9J8</a>\n乌兹别克斯坦风味餐厅，羊肉手抓饭很好吃，套餐3000吃到饱。甜点搭配茶水也很有一番风味。\n<img src=\"https://blog.himikouchuu.com/api/blob/images/aace5fb7458809488600c707165272d9d24c6548.jpg#blurhash=LGLVmw%25L5Ix%5D%3Dg%3D_%3D_Rj0UsA%5EIjE&amp;width=3024&amp;height=3024\" alt=\"IMG_0888_jpg.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://blog.himikouchuu.com/api/blob/images/d5d8339ce2fd117cdd0f3f7e530ace293b73e43b.jpg#blurhash=LCKS%3BNGb%23RTx%3FYsF%25eIVxFTK%7DlDO&amp;width=3024&amp;height=3024\" alt=\"IMG_0889_jpg.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://blog.himikouchuu.com/api/blob/images/d489d6cb7e12001ab179f3523f837c02fc163207.jpg#blurhash=LQMYsUITIBnNwtxtt6n%244T-%3AxBxt&amp;width=3024&amp;height=3024\" alt=\"IMG_0892_jpg.jpg\"></p>\n<p>Mucho Chicken\n<a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/i8JbcXZ6FZHEXLzV8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://maps.app.goo.gl/i8JbcXZ6FZHEXLzV8</a>\n墨西哥菜，有人说像中国菜，去了发现真的有棒棒鸡。\n<img src=\"https://blog.himikouchuu.com/api/blob/images/32799eb99d3d999e74006e7b16ccdfd4441ec7e5.jpg#blurhash=LQLCnh%252XU%24*%25M%252SOxa17Si%252R.&amp;width=3024&amp;height=3024\" alt=\"IMG_1617_jpg.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://blog.himikouchuu.com/api/blob/images/09b398860a1177f68575153a4d4f43e3505b53d5.jpg#blurhash=LZJ%405c%252%253WT0Li_W%3DWqIuozM_sp&amp;width=3024&amp;height=3024\" alt=\"IMG_1620_jpg.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://blog.himikouchuu.com/api/blob/images/79c566f32e7ed83e46e77cede5405714d990464a.jpg#blurhash=LFLovCDQ%7EU%24z7J10xu%5Eju5.8E2I%3D&amp;width=3024&amp;height=3024\" alt=\"IMG_1623_jpg.jpg\"></p>\n<p>Sedra\n<a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/gNrEkbGZtV8e6qi79\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://maps.app.goo.gl/gNrEkbGZtV8e6qi79</a>\n埃及菜，去了发现有很多当地人吃，份量巨大，米的味道很特别，饼也很好吃，价格也很实惠。\n<img src=\"https://blog.himikouchuu.com/api/blob/images/9749fb73e6ffea2af8a6f5bee7a6bd3a0eeb1d33.jpg#blurhash=LBGt%3D%3Dxtxv-mxtRlt7s%2BY8t7RPNL&amp;width=3024&amp;height=3024\" alt=\"IMG_1791_jpg.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://blog.himikouchuu.com/api/blob/images/d712db72b4d9d1e2c94ac4454f9bfe7338b3e236.jpg#blurhash=LBHm_ji%5DKT-TIqV%3FSPnN1%2CnNs9s%2C&amp;width=3024&amp;height=3024\" alt=\"IMG_1794_jpg.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://blog.himikouchuu.com/api/blob/images/f90dbfa88302fa41fbc0075cfa14259fdf06b348.jpg#blurhash=LCINHkx%5Ex_Rl%7DQeSNft8D%25E2McZ%7E&amp;width=3024&amp;height=3024\" alt=\"IMG_1799_jpg.jpg\"></p>\n<p>ブラジルレストラン ジオゴ\n<a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/egkCBV3DXeQDdEmv8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://maps.app.goo.gl/egkCBV3DXeQDdEmv8</a>\n巴西菜，烤猪排很好吃，但是价格略贵。\n<img src=\"https://blog.himikouchuu.com/api/blob/images/f7ed1c191aab14310abb4b4344c03d9327305abb.jpg#blurhash=LCI%7C%25fRi.8x%5E8wIUI%40xt%25JJp8%5ER-&amp;width=3024&amp;height=3024\" alt=\"A316B898-6EF7-4D67-94D4-67A52661DE4E.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://blog.himikouchuu.com/api/blob/images/c41c8e7314a27a3af855f020cec1b17df77eb894.jpg#blurhash=LIH%2C%238bHOFS%7Ehzjb9%5DWB%7EBw%5DI%3D-A&amp;width=3024&amp;height=3024\" alt=\"BCE98481-C8E5-4D46-9047-CE78A0463B6A.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://blog.himikouchuu.com/api/blob/images/923d7ea1cd3f0c172d785c0525b1d33f1b9e92e4.jpg#blurhash=LKI%7B%3F1RjIuRkyWIVI%3BoI1iI%3Br%3FkB&amp;width=3024&amp;height=3024\" alt=\"76EC4224-7287-4155-9A08-051FDBB28911.jpg\"></p>\n<p>Bar España\n<a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/EkqDagTPShWtLxYq9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://maps.app.goo.gl/EkqDagTPShWtLxYq9</a>\n西班牙菜，海鲜饭非常实惠，各种菜品也水准颇高。\n<img src=\"https://blog.himikouchuu.com/api/blob/images/81593aebe7c3da309a9c4e4c777b7f895bbeca51.jpg#blurhash=LII%7C8erD9%25rX%7EV9Zo%23M%7BKlRi-lRP&amp;width=3024&amp;height=3024\" alt=\"IMG_3026_jpg.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://blog.himikouchuu.com/api/blob/images/52962de643668ce9d12f919d003b4a7dea97035c.jpg#blurhash=LMKT0v-U%7Eq%25201t6IUbc%25gxt4%3AkC&amp;width=3024&amp;height=3024\" alt=\"IMG_3027_jpg.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://blog.himikouchuu.com/api/blob/images/610d185fec215db92590a3b35e12c5dd35d61e53.jpg#blurhash=LHMPBzR-Ekr%3DR3NGtTV%3FKiIU0LM%7B&amp;width=3024&amp;height=3024\" alt=\"IMG_3034_jpg.jpg\"></p>\n<p>RicoRico\n<a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/r5AFdKicRMF7vnF56\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://maps.app.goo.gl/r5AFdKicRMF7vnF56</a>\n欧式居酒屋，火腿海鲜饭都很不错。</p>\n<p>Namuchai Okazaki\n<a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/4WZdhbcXiZikWfJN6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://maps.app.goo.gl/4WZdhbcXiZikWfJN6</a>\n泰国大使馆验证过的泰国菜，伴侣在吃过菠萝饭之后，梦中也喃喃自语菠萝饭好好吃呀。</p>\n<p>Mai Pen Rai Fushimi\n<a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/sMvhecymX93jzi7V9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://maps.app.goo.gl/sMvhecymX93jzi7V9</a>\n泰国菜，很好吃。\n<img src=\"https://blog.himikouchuu.com/api/blob/images/5a4653ed486abc4c3713671e68de9b8ab74b823e.jpg#blurhash=LGG%5Bf%3BpKM-oN%2CkocNKs%3A0Or%3DnLRO&amp;width=3024&amp;height=3024\" alt=\"IMG_3955.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://blog.himikouchuu.com/api/blob/images/edc05caa51bb0f5667b93474ee474c9e3466e7d6.jpg#blurhash=LJIW%3Do%3FZKi%3FGj%5B%24jM%7BS%251lR%3B%23QIX&amp;width=3024&amp;height=3024\" alt=\"IMG_3957.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://blog.himikouchuu.com/api/blob/images/61a49b21fb66cadce2292ad71930af729f2e3f50.jpg#blurhash=LQI%3Bt_%25g_4-%3BnMj%5EM%7BjvtQWBRPRj&amp;width=3024&amp;height=3024\" alt=\"IMG_3959.jpg\"></p>",
